---
import Base from '@layouts/Base.astro';
import { offers, contact } from '@config/site';
---
<Base title="Competitive Radar" description="Ongoing competitive intelligence for pricing changes, product launches, positioning shifts, funding, integrations and emerging rivals." path="/market-intelligence/">
  <section class="rad-final__hero" data-surface="dark"><div class="container-wide rad-final__hero-grid"><div><span class="label">COMPETITIVE RADAR</span><h1>Know when the competitive picture changes.</h1><p>A point-in-time brief answers a question now. Competitive Radar keeps decision-relevant competitor moves current after the first answer.</p><div class="rad-final__actions"><a class="btn btn--lg" href="/contact/?intent=radar">Ask About Competitive Radar <span>→</span></a><a href="/method/">See the evidence standard →</a></div></div><aside><small class="mono">BEST WHEN</small><b>Stale intelligence can change the decision.</b><p>The job is not to collect every mention. It is to surface verified changes that matter.</p></aside></div></section>

  <main class="rad-final">
    <section class="section rad-final__fit"><div class="container-wide rad-final__split"><div><span class="label">ONGOING, NOT AUTOMATIC NOISE</span><h2>Monitor the moves that can change a decision.</h2><p>Radar filters for material change, verifies the source and preserves the boundary between observed fact and analytical interpretation. A mention is not an alert just because a monitoring tool found it.</p></div><div class="rad-final__formula"><span>OBSERVE</span><i>→</i><span>VERIFY</span><i>→</i><span>CLASSIFY</span><i>→</i><strong>SURFACE WHAT MATTERS</strong></div></div></section>

    <section class="section rad-final__signals"><div class="container-wide"><header><span class="label">WHAT CAN BE MONITORED</span><h2>The signal set follows the decisions your team cares about.</h2></header><div class="rad-final__cards"><article><b>01</b><h3>Pricing</h3><p>Plan changes, packaging shifts, discount structures and public enterprise-pricing signals.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h3>Product</h3><p>Launches, changelogs, integrations, capability expansion and product-surface changes.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h3>Positioning</h3><p>Homepage, category, comparison and claim changes that signal strategic movement.</p></article><article><b>04</b><h3>Company moves</h3><p>Funding, expansion, leadership and other public signals relevant to competitive capacity.</p></article><article><b>05</b><h3>Emerging rivals</h3><p>New companies moving close enough to the competitive set to deserve validation.</p></article><article><b>06</b><h3>Decision alerts</h3><p>Verified changes framed around why they may matter, not forwarded as unfiltered news.</p></article></div></div></section>

    <section class="section rad-final__scope" data-surface="dark"><div class="container-wide rad-final__split"><div><span class="label">SCOPE</span><h2>Define what deserves watching before monitoring begins.</h2><p>The competitor set, signal types, cadence and decision context vary by company. We define what deserves monitoring, how often the evidence should be reviewed and what threshold should trigger an alert.</p></div><aside class="rad-final__commercial"><small class="mono">ENGAGEMENT</small><strong>{offers.radar.priceDisplay}</strong><p>{offers.radar.priceNote}.</p><small class="mono">CADENCE</small><b>{offers.radar.delivery}</b></aside></div></section>

    <section class="section rad-final__cta"><div class="container rad-final__cta-inner"><span class="label">KEEP THE VIEW CURRENT</span><h2>Tell us what needs watching.</h2><p>We will scope the competitor set, signals and cadence around the decisions your team cannot afford to make on stale information.</p><a class="btn btn--lg" href="/contact/?intent=radar">Ask About Competitive Radar <span>→</span></a><a class="rad-final__email" href={`mailto:${contact.emailDisplay}`}>{contact.emailDisplay}</a></div></section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
.rad-final{background:#f8f5ef}.rad-final__hero{background:#030914;color:#f4f8ff;padding:clamp(2.8rem,5vw,4.8rem) 0}.rad-final__hero-grid,.rad-final__split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:clamp(2rem,6vw,5rem);align-items:center}.rad-final__hero h1,.rad-final h2{margin:.55rem 0 .8rem;font-size:clamp(2.7rem,5vw,5.2rem);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.052em}.rad-final__hero p{max-width:52rem;color:#b8c8db;line-height:1.65;font-size:1.04rem}.rad-final__hero aside{padding:1.2rem;border:1px solid rgba(111,160,219,.18);border-radius:.85rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.025)}.rad-final__hero aside small{color:#aa8aff;font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.1em}.rad-final__hero aside b{display:block;margin:.45rem 0;font-size:1.25rem}.rad-final__hero aside p{font-size:.86rem;margin:0;color:#8fa5bf}.rad-final__actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.8rem;align-items:center;margin-top:1.3rem}.rad-final__actions>a:not(.btn),.rad-final__scope a{color:#b49bff;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}.rad-final__fit{background:#fff}.rad-final__fit p,.rad-final__signals p,.rad-final__cta p{color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.65}.rad-final__formula{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto auto auto auto auto auto auto;gap:.55rem;align-items:center;padding:1.2rem;border:1px solid rgba(31,58,87,.12);border-radius:.85rem;background:#f6f8fa;font:800 .68rem/1.3 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.06em}.rad-final__formula i{font-style:normal;color:#75869a}.rad-final__formula strong{color:#745aca}.rad-final__signals{background:#f3eee6}.rad-final__signals header{max-width:68rem}.rad-final__cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:.7rem;margin-top:1.3rem}.rad-final__cards article{padding:1rem;border:1px solid rgba(31,58,87,.12);border-radius:.75rem;background:#fff}.rad-final__cards b{font:800 .56rem/1 var(--font-mono);color:#745aca}.rad-final__cards h3{margin:.5rem 0 .3rem}.rad-final__cards p{margin:0;font-size:.84rem;line-height:1.5}.rad-final__scope{background:#030914;color:#f4f8ff}.rad-final__scope p{color:#9fb2c9;line-height:1.65}.rad-final__commercial{padding:1.2rem;border:1px solid rgba(115,164,219,.17);border-radius:.85rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.025);display:grid;gap:.35rem}.rad-final__commercial small{color:#7f95b0;font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-top:.5rem}.rad-final__commercial strong{font-size:1.55rem}.rad-final__commercial p{margin:0;font-size:.85rem}.rad-final__cta{background:#fff}.rad-final__cta-inner{max-width:64rem;text-align:center}.rad-final__cta-inner p{max-width:48rem;margin:.8rem auto 1.1rem}.rad-final__email{display:block;margin-top:1rem;color:#6b59b4;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}@media(max-width:860px){.rad-final__hero-grid,.rad-final__split{grid-template-columns:1fr}.rad-final__cards{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.rad-final__formula{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:560px){.rad-final__cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.rad-final__actions{display:grid}.rad-final__actions a{width:100%}}
</style>
